# Definition of Done

- Suite green in Docker; ruff/mypy clean when code changed; smoke or UI audit done.
- Card bookkeeping: Improvements noted, follow-ups raised, Review evidence for cards >= 61.
- A command not executed is `BLOCKED`, never assumed green.
- Final review only after red→green, Decision log present, risk tier declared (`docs/agents/workflows/final-review.md`).
- Closing commit uses explicit paths only; stamp `## Closing commit`. Do not push/merge to `main` unless the human asks.
